  "term": "ziprasidone",
  "definition": "Ziprasidone is an atypical antipsychotic drug with antischizophrenic effects. It acts on dopamine and serotonin receptor systems and also affects serotonin and norepinephrine reuptake, although the exact way it produces its antischizophrenic effect is not fully known.",
